    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The slums are rotting. You are spilling out.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ezekiel</strong> has moved into the slums. She finds herself enamored with its inhabitants: three girls, in particular.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend an angel, fall in love, and break them by awakening them. Whisper their tragedies, tell them lies and tell them\u00a0truths, sing your sweet corrupting song like <span class=\"bb_strike\">lovers</span> do. Push them over the edge.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a matter of <i>if</i> they fall... but how they fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/ac2628baf9e193141a9b77dad34cfd6f.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seraphim Slum</i>\u00a0is a sapphic liminal visual novel revolving around fallen angels, the horror of intimate relationships, self-perceived sins, predestination, and love conquering self.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ezekiel as you explore the slum\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping Macy, Salxire, and Oriel unravel their self-suppressions and succumb to their desires.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">Your love's a perfect sort of obsessive. Some could say it's devouring.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delving into the liminal slum as it is eaten alive by your <i>nature</i>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding out what it truly means to have free will and autonomy\u2026 at the price of corruption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME OVERVIEW</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>definitive edition</strong> of Seraphim Slum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/eafc82add553d3bba2ecc8c5d54cd2ca.poster.avif?t=1737208025\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/eafc82add553d3bba2ecc8c5d54cd2ca.webm?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/eafc82add553d3bba2ecc8c5d54cd2ca.mp4?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dark sapphic</strong> visual novel about fallen angels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 female love interests: <strong>Macy</strong>, <strong>Salxire</strong> and <strong>Oriel</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Esoteric and poetic</strong> musings on philosophy and autonomy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-based branching</strong> with <strong>4 unique endings</strong>... and a bonus <i>Free Roam</i> route where you explore the slum's depths...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many scene illustrations</strong> and a <i>gore toggle</i> for a darker take on an angel's love...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully <strong>voice-acted</strong> dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom-made OST</strong>... and a <i>hidden</i> bonus track exclusive to the ideal ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings list, <strong>CG gallery</strong>, and Steam achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of <strong>5-6 hours</strong> for a full run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.poster.avif?t=1737208025\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.webm?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.mp4?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONTENT WARNINGS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game isn't suitable for those who are easily disturbed.</strong> Please play at your own discretion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epilepsy warning, depictions of mental illness, unhealthy relationships, body horror, distressing sound effects, deranged sapphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></sp