e-acted</strong> dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom-made OST</strong>... and a <i>hidden</i> bonus track exclusive to the ideal ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings list, <strong>CG gallery</strong>, and Steam achievements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of <strong>5-6 hours</strong> for a full run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.poster.avif?t=1737208025\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.webm?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/f99f2782aab7bfe897d12d50ed92b746.mp4?t=1737208025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONTENT WARNINGS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game isn't suitable for those who are easily disturbed.</strong> Please play at your own discretion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epilepsy warning, depictions of mental illness, unhealthy relationships, body horror, distressing sound effects, deranged sapphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791180/extras/4876a023135999da2c754e9ee8f19f77.avif?t=1737208025\" width=610 height=77 /></span></p