    "reviews": "\u201cA bunch of fallen, lesbian archangels and a prophet who lies as easily as she breathes\u2026 This game had me so in tune with my sapphic side...\u201d<br>Fuwanovel<br><br>\u201cI was honest to god blown away by this game, from the moment I saw the cover, and then the art and then downloading and playing it... it's clear as day that so much amazing talent came together to make this, with a lot of very cool visions culminating in something that scratched the itch that games like [We Know The Devil] and pretty much everything by kittyhorrorshow left behind.\u201d<br>Inyssa<br><br>\u201cNot as much a story as it is art, poetry, music and snippets of philosophy pieced together into a fascinating and sometimes confusing mind trip.\u201d<br>LittleMissLeeStories<br>",
